  m_text: '<size=22>3 or more SCATTERS will trigger the Hearts of Paris Free Spins
    Bonus. Player is

    awarded 7 free spins. During the free spins, if player spins 2 or more fully stacked

    AMY and/or JAMES symbols, the symbols will hold and the other reels will respin

    and wins will be evaluated again. AMY and JAMES symbols will pay mixed during

    free spins and award a new paytable. Free Spins cannot be re-triggered.

